    "default_monthly_withdrawal": 3000.0,
    "default_inflation_pct": 2.5,
    "minimum_horizon_years": 1,
    "maximum_horizon_years": 70,
    "_comment": "Projection paths resample consecutive 12-month blocks to preserve short-run return dependence. A portfolio needs three years of observed monthly returns for the standard model. Shorter portfolio histories spanning at least 30 days are extended to 36 months by annualizing the longest first-to-last return and repeating the centered observed monthly pattern. This synthetic extension is disclosed in the interface. The selected benchmark is used only when even that minimum portfolio span is unavailable."
  },
